# DEVELOPMENT WORKFLOW RULE

After completing every phase:

1. Test all relevant endpoints using Postman.
2. Test database queries using pgAdmin or psql.
3. Verify the output before moving to the next phase.
4. Handle validation and edge cases.
5. Commit the working code to GitHub.
6. Use a descriptive Git commit message.
7. Tag major completed phases when appropriate.

Example:

git add .
git commit -m "Phase 3: Implement Transformer entity extraction"
git tag phase-3-entity-extraction

