# TARGET OUTCOME

IntervAI should not simply be:

"Upload resume → Generate 100 questions."

It should be:

"Upload resume → Understand the candidate → Identify claims and
relationships → Ask the most relevant question → Evaluate the answer
→ Identify the knowledge gap → Decide what to ask next → Build an
evidence-based candidate profile."

This adaptive, resume-grounded interview loop is the core intelligence
of the project.
